# Lottie - sample documents and the split schema tree stay local. Only the
# bundled schema is tracked: docs/lottie-and-thorvg.md is written against it,
# and it is the form to use for validation (see that document's section 2.4).
# Note: `lottie/*`, not `lottie/`, so the negation below can take effect -
# git does not descend into an excluded directory.
lottie/*
!lottie/lottie.schema.json
!lottie/schema

